# ─── DATABASE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Phase 17: Desktop app uses SQLite (file-based, offline-capable)
# Dev: file:./dev.db (relative to project root)
# Prod (Electron): set at runtime by Electron main process via app.getPath('userData')
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"
